{
  "enabled": true,
  "name": "MCP 配置备份提醒",
  "description": "每次 mcp.json 被修改后，提醒用户执行备份命令，防止配置丢失",
  "version": "1",
  "when": {
    "type": "fileEdited",
    "patterns": [
      "**/.kiro/settings/mcp.json"
    ]
  },
  "then": {
    "type": "askAgent",
    "prompt": "mcp.json 刚刚被修改了。请立即提醒用户执行以下备份命令，并告知备份位置：\n\n```powershell\nCopy-Item \"d:\\workspace\\myBot\\.kiro\\settings\\mcp.json\" \"d:\\workspace\\myBot\\docs\\mcp-backup\\mcp-workspace.json\" -Force\nCopy-Item \"c:\\Users\\Willi\\.kiro\\settings\\mcp.json\" \"d:\\workspace\\myBot\\docs\\mcp-backup\\mcp-user.json\" -Force\n```\n\n备份文件位置：`d:\\workspace\\myBot\\docs\\mcp-backup\\`"
  }
}